# BusyBox options for the compatibility suite (test/compat), turned on over
# `make allnoconfig`: a broad set of everyday applets, to see how much of a
# normal userland runs. Not the kernel's built-in BusyBox (user/busybox.config).
# The binary must fit one 1 MiB disk slot (src/diskfs.bastio).
